<title>MEXICO: GFfina 1996 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>GFfina 1996 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Financiero Fina Value (GFfina) on Wednesday reported a net loss of 2.69 million pesos for 1996 compared to a net profit of 14.65 million pesos for 1995.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9565))</p>
